WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:04.340
Before you start, watch the orange area, not the height.

00:00:04.690 --> 00:00:06.700
The area is the change in momentum.

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:12.340
Make the stop softer and the area stays the same, but the force goes down.

00:00:13.190 --> 00:00:16.000
Now see if you can get the force below 5 newtons,

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:18.450
without changing the mass or the speed.
